        <p><em>Last updated: September 3, 2026</em></p>

        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>Monarch Liquor ("we," "us") operates monarchliquor.com. This site is an informational website for our two Austin-area stores. We keep things simple: we don't run our own accounts, logins, or payment systems on this site, and we don't sell your personal information.</p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>This website itself does not collect personal information through forms or accounts. When you contact us by phone or email, we use the information you provide only to respond to your inquiry.</p>
        <p>Online ordering is handled by our e-commerce partner, BottleCapps, at <a href="https://monarchliquor.bottlecapps.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">monarchliquor.bottlecapps.com</a>. When you place an order there, the information you provide (name, address, payment details, date of birth) is collected and processed under BottleCapps' own privacy practices. Please review their policies on their site before ordering.</p>

        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>This site uses a small number of third-party services that may set cookies or receive standard technical data (like your IP address) when pages load:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Google Maps</strong> &mdash; embedded maps on our contact and about pages.</li>
          <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> &mdash; the typefaces used across the site.</li>
          <li><strong>Font Awesome (CDN)</strong> &mdash; the icons used across the site.</li>
          <li><strong>BottleCapps</strong> &mdash; our online ordering platform, linked from shop buttons.</li>
          <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> &mdash; anonymous usage statistics (pages viewed, buttons clicked such as "Order Delivery" or "Call") that help us improve the site. No personal information is collected by this site itself.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Each of these providers has its own privacy policy governing the data it processes.</p>

        <h2>Age Requirement</h2>
        <p>Our products are intended for adults 21 years of age and older. By using this site and ordering from us, you confirm that you are at least 21. Every delivery and pickup requires a valid government-issued photo ID.</p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>Questions about this policy? Reach us at <a href="mailto:Retail@monarchliquor.com">Retail@monarchliquor.com</a> or (512) 614-4949, or stop by either store &mdash; 1902 E. MLK Jr. Blvd, Austin, TX 78702 or 1700 Ranch Road 620 N #107B, Austin, TX 78734.</p>
      </div>
